&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Microsoft AI, we are focused on accelerating the development and deployment of AI technologies that empower people and organizations to achieve more. We are on a mission to train the world&#39;s most capable AI frontier models, pushing the boundaries of scale, performance, and product deployment for Microsoft AI models. As a fast-moving, startup AI lab within Microsoft, our team operates with a strong bias for action, embracing rapid growth, continuous innovation, and operational excellence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
