&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;41&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e43db32d6868&quot;&gt;As organizations rapidly adopt AI applications and agentic systems, security teams need visibility and control over how these technologies are being used. Datadog&#39;s AI &amp;amp; Data Security product helps customers discover, secure, and govern AI usage across their environments ensuring sensitive data is properly managed from model training through production.&lt;/p&gt;
